{"seq":2,"slug":"lifecycle-and-capabilities","title":"生命周期与能力协商","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/lsp-specification/lifecycle-and-capabilities","wordCount":983,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"生命周期与能力协商\">生命周期与能力协商</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LSP 会话的本质是一次<strong>双向能力协商</strong>：客户端声明自己支持哪些编辑能力，服务端声明自己提供哪些语言功能，两者取交集决定实际可用的功能集合。协商在 initialize 握手时完成，此后整个会话都在这个交集内运行。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>载体</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>客户端能力</td>\n<td>声明编辑器能做什么（如应用编辑、snippet）</td>\n<td><code>ClientCapabilities</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务端能力</td>\n<td>声明服务端提供什么（如补全、诊断）</td>\n<td><code>ServerCapabilities</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态注册</td>\n<td>运行时按需增删能力</td>\n<td><code>client/registerCapability</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命周期状态</td>\n<td>约束每个阶段允许的消息</td>\n<td>Uninitialized/Running/ShuttingDown</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>能力协商之所以必要，是因为 LSP 要同时服务 VS Code、Neovim、Helix 等差异巨大的客户端——只有显式声明能力，服务端才不会向不支持的客户端发送无法处理的数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"初始化握手\">初始化握手</h2><p>LSP 的生命周期始于一次严格的握手过程。客户端发送 <code>initialize</code> 请求，服务端返回其能力集合，然后客户端发送 <code>initialized</code> 通知确认握手完成。在此之前，服务端不应处理任何其他请求。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface InitializeParams {&#10;  processId: number | null;&#10;  clientInfo?: { name: string; version?: string };&#10;  rootUri: string | null;&#10;  capabilities: ClientCapabilities;&#10;  initializationOptions?: unknown;&#10;  trace?: &#39;off&#39; | &#39;messages&#39; | &#39;verbose&#39;;&#10;  workspaceFolders?: WorkspaceFolder[] | null;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface InitializeResult {&#10;  capabilities: ServerCapabilities;&#10;  serverInfo?: { name: string; version?: string };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InitializeParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  processId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  clientInfo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rootUri</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  capabilities</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ClientCapabilities</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  initializationOptions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  trace</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'off'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'messages'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'verbose'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  workspaceFolders</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WorkspaceFolder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InitializeResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  capabilities</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ServerCapabilities</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  serverInfo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端(编辑器)&#10;    participant S as 语言服务器&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: initialize (请求)&#10;    Note right of S: 解析客户端能力&lt;br/&gt;计算服务端能力&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: InitializeResult&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: initialized (通知)&#10;    Note over C,S: 握手完成,开始正常通信&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didOpen&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: textDocument/publishDiagnostics\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端(编辑器)\n    participant S as 语言服务器\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: initialize (请求)\n    Note right of S: 解析客户端能力&lt;br/&gt;计算服务端能力\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: InitializeResult\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: initialized (通知)\n    Note over C,S: 握手完成,开始正常通信\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didOpen\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: textDocument/publishDiagnostics</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>processId</code> 参数让服务端能监控父进程状态。如果编辑器进程崩溃退出，服务端可以通过检测父进程终止来自行清理退出。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"客户端能力\">客户端能力</h2><p>ClientCapabilities 声明了编辑器支持的功能特性。服务端必须检查这些能力来决定自己的行为边界。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ClientCapabilities {&#10;  workspace?: {&#10;    applyEdit?: boolean;&#10;    workspaceEdit?: {&#10;      documentChanges?: boolean;&#10;      resourceOperations?: ResourceOperationKind[];&#10;      normalizesLineEndings?: boolean;&#10;    };&#10;    didChangeConfiguration?: { dynamicRegistration?: boolean };&#10;    didChangeWatchedFiles?: { dynamicRegistration?: boolean };&#10;    symbol?: { dynamicRegistration?: boolean };&#10;    configuration?: boolean;&#10;    workspaceFolders?: boolean;&#10;  };&#10;  textDocument?: {&#10;    synchronization?: {&#10;      dynamicRegistration?: boolean;&#10;      willSave?: boolean;&#10;      willSaveWaitUntil?: boolean;&#10;      didSave?: boolean;&#10;    };&#10;    completion?: {&#10;      dynamicRegistration?: boolean;&#10;      completionItem?: {&#10;        snippetSupport?: boolean;&#10;        commitCharactersSupport?: boolean;&#10;        insertReplaceSupport?: boolean;&#10;        labelDetailsSupport?: boolean;&#10;      };&#10;    };&#10;    hover?: { dynamicRegistration?: boolean; contentFormat?: MarkupKind[] };&#10;    definition?: { dynamicRegistration?: boolean; linkSupport?: boolean };&#10;  };&#10;  general?: {&#10;    staleRequestSupport?: { cancel: boolean; retryOnContentModified: string[] };&#10;    positionEncodings?: PositionEncodingKind[];&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ClientCapabilities</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  workspace</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    applyEdit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#00