<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    SC[ServerCapabilities] --&gt; SYNC[textDocumentSync]&#10;    SC --&gt; COMP[completionProvider]&#10;    SC --&gt; HOVER[hoverProvider]&#10;    SC --&gt; DEF[definitionProvider]&#10;    SC --&gt; DIAG[diagnosticProvider]&#10;    SC --&gt; ACTION[codeActionProvider]&#10;    SC --&gt; RENAME[renameProvider]&#10;    SC --&gt; WS[workspace]&#10;&#10;    SYNC --&gt; FULL[全量同步]&#10;    SYNC --&gt; INCR[增量同步]&#10;    COMP --&gt; TRIGGER[triggerCharacters]&#10;    COMP --&gt; RESOLVE[resolveProvider]&#10;    DIAG --&gt; PUSH[推送模式]&#10;    DIAG --&gt; PULL[拉取模式]\">graph TD\n    SC[ServerCapabilities] --&gt; SYNC[textDocumentSync]\n    SC --&gt; COMP[completionProvider]\n    SC --&gt; HOVER[hoverProvider]\n    SC --&gt; DEF[definitionProvider]\n    SC --&gt; DIAG[diagnosticProvider]\n    SC --&gt; ACTION[codeActionProvider]\n    SC --&gt; RENAME[renameProvider]\n    SC --&gt; WS[workspace]\n\n    SYNC --&gt; FULL[全量同步]\n    SYNC --&gt; INCR[增量同步]\n    COMP --&gt; TRIGGER[triggerCharacters]\n    COMP --&gt; RESOLVE[resolveProvider]\n    DIAG --&gt; PUSH[推送模式]\n    DIAG --&gt; PULL[拉取模式]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>textDocumentSync</td>\n<td>Options/Kind</td>\n<td>文本同步策略（全量 1 / 增量 2）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>completionProvider</td>\n<td>Options</td>\n<td>触发字符、resolve 支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hoverProvider</td>\n<td>boolean/Options</td>\n<td>鼠标悬停信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>definitionProvider</td>\n<td>boolean/Options</td>\n<td>跳转定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>diagnosticProvider</td>\n<td>Options</td>\n<td>推送或拉取模式的诊断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>codeActionProvider</td>\n<td>Options</td>\n<td>快速修复与重构操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>renameProvider</td>\n<td>boolean/Options</td>\n<td>重命名支持（含 prepareRename）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"动态注册\">动态注册</h2><p>除了在 initialize 响应中静态声明能力，LSP 还支持运行时动态注册和取消注册能力。这允许服务端根据项目状态按需启用功能。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RegistrationParams {&#10;  registrations: Registration[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Registration {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  method: string;&#10;  registerOptions?: unknown;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface UnregistrationParams {&#10;  unregisterations: Unregistration[];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RegistrationParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  registrations</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Registration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Registration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  registerOptions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UnregistrationParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  unregisterations</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Unregistration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>动态注册典型流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant S as 服务端&#10;&#10;    Note over C,S: 初始化时未声明 completionProvider&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: client/registerCapability&#10;    Note left of C: 注册 textDocument/completion&lt;br/&gt;triggerCharacters: [&quot;.&quot;, &quot;/&quot;]&#10;    C--&gt;&gt;S: 注册成功&#10;    Note over C,S: 补全功能现在可用&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/completion&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: CompletionList&#10;    Note over C,S: 项目配置变更...&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: client/unregisterCapability&#10;    Note left of C: 取消注册 textDocument/completion\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant S as 服务端\n\n    Note over C,S: 初始化时未声明 completionProvider\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: client/registerCapability\n    Note left of C: 注册 textDocument/completion&lt;br/&gt;triggerCharacters: [\".\", \"/\"]\n    C--&gt;&gt;S: 注册成功\n    Note over C,S: 补全功能现在可用\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/completion\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: CompletionList\n    Note over C,S: 项目配置变更...\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: client/unregisterCapability\n    Note left of C: 取消注册 textDocument/completion</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 动态注册的 <code>id</code> 必须全局唯一，用于后续取消注册。建议使用 UUID 作为注册 ID。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"关闭与退出\">关闭与退出</h2><p>LSP 定义了优雅的关闭流程。客户端发送 <code>shutdown</code> 请求通知服务端准备退出，服务端完成清理后返回响应，最后客户端发送 <code>exit</code> 通知终止进程。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"connection.onShutdown(() =&gt; {&#10;  cleanupResources();&#10;  cancelPendingOperations();&#10;  flushDiagnostics();&#10;});&#10;&#10;connection.onExit(() =&gt; {&#10;  process.exit(shutdownReceived ? 0 : 1);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">connection.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onShutdown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  cleanupResources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  cancelPendingOperations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  flushDiagnostics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">connection.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onExit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  process.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(shutdownReceived </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Uninitialized&#10;    Uninitialized --&gt; Initializing: initialize 请求&#10;    Initializing --&gt; Running: initialized 通知&#10;    Running --&gt; Running: 正常请求/通知&#10;    Running --&gt; ShuttingDown: shutdown 请求&#10;    ShuttingDown --&gt; Stopped: exit 通知&#10;    Stopped --&gt; [*]&#10;&#10;    Running --&gt; Stopped: 异常退出&#10;    Uninitialized --&gt; Stopped: 异常退出\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Uninitialized\n    Uninitialized --&gt; Initializing: initialize 请求\n    Initializing --&gt; Running: initialized 通知\n    Running --&gt; Running: 正常请求/通知\n    Running --&gt; ShuttingDown: shutdown 请求\n    ShuttingDown --&gt; Stopped: exit 通知\n    Stopped --&gt; [*]\n\n    Running --&gt; Stopped: 异常退出\n    Uninitialized --&gt; Stopped: 异常退出</pre><p>关闭流程的状态转换与行为约束：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>接受的请求</th>\n<th>退出码</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Uninitialized</td>\n<td>仅 initialize</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Running</td>\n<td>所有已注册的请求/通知</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ShuttingDown</td>\n<td>仅 exit（其他返回错误）</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stopped</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 如果客户端崩溃未发送 shutdown，服务端应设置超时机制（如监听 stdin 关闭）来检测并自行退出。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((生命周期与能力协商))&#10;    初始化握手&#10;      initialize 请求&#10;      initialized 通知&#10;      processId 监控&#10;    客户端能力&#10;      工作区编辑支持&#10;      代码片段支持&#10;      位置编码协商&#10;    服务端能力&#10;      textDocumentSync&#10;      completionProvider&#10;      diagnosticProvider&#10;    动态注册&#10;      运行时启用/禁用&#10;      UUID 唯一标识&#10;      按需功能加载&#10;    关闭流程&#10;      shutdown + exit&#10;      优雅资源清理&#10;      超时退出机制\">mindmap\n  root((生命周期与能力协商))\n    初始化握手\n      initialize 请求\n      initialized 通知\n      processId 监控\n    客户端能力\n      工作区编辑支持\n      代码片段支持\n      位置编码协商\n    服务端能力\n      textDocumentSync\n      completionProvider\n      diagnosticProvider\n    动态注册\n      运行时启用/禁用\n      UUID 唯一标识\n      按需功能加载\n    关闭流程\n      shutdown + exit\n      优雅资源清理\n      超时退出机制</pre><ul>\n<li>LSP 生命周期遵循严格的 <strong>initialize → initialized → 正常通信 → shutdown → exit</strong> 流程。</li>\n<li><strong>ClientCapabilities</strong> 声明编辑器支持的功能边界，服务端必须据此调整自身行为。</li>\n<li><strong>ServerCapabilities</strong> 在初始化响应中静态声明，也可通过 <code>client/registerCapability</code> <strong>动态注册</strong>。</li>\n<li>动态注册允许服务端根据项目状态按需启用功能，使用唯一 <code>id</code> 标识注册项。</li>\n<li>关闭流程需要 <strong>shutdown 请求 + exit 通知</strong> 两步完成，服务端应实现超时退出以应对客户端异常。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生命周期与能力协商","id":"生命周期与能力协商"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"初始化握手","id":"初始化握手"},{"level":2,"text":"客户端能力","id":"客户端能力"},{"level":2,"text":"服务端能力","id":"服务端能力"},{"level":2,"text":"动态注册","id":"动态注册"},{"level":2,"text":"关闭与退出","id":"关闭与退出"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"JSON-RPC 传输层","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/lsp-specification/json-rpc-transport"},"next":{"title":"文本同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/lsp-specification/text-synchronization"}}